; Both `:loops` and `:events` are default-only with no author
; resolution -> schema ambiguity, not document overpresence. The
; `multiple_defaulted_alternatives_in_group` code surfaces this to
; the schema author. See
; docs/plans/exclusive-group-default-semantics.md.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code multiple_defaulted_alternatives_in_group :path [phrase]))
